  "_doc": "Vehicle glass (agent_glass.gdshader): transmittance 0.70, the least a windscreen and the windows the driver needs may let through (CONTRAN Resolução 960/2022 art. 4º I); ior 1.52, soda-lime glass, roughness 0 (physicallybased.info Glass); tint the 4.0's cool grey-blue (#7896a2), no source behind it, at 40 % in linear light: this sun lights it more than the 4.0's, and at its own value the panes showed milky over a dark cabin (par-hatch-frente).",
